<title>USA: Pakistan seeks 500,000 tonnes wheat - embassy.</title>
<headline>Pakistan seeks 500,000 tonnes wheat - embassy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan is tendering on June 25 for 500,000 tonnes of optional origin white wheat, July 11-August 10 shipment, a spokesman at the country's U.S. embassy in Washington said.</p>
<p>He said the wheat would be either from the United States, Australia or Canada.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
